                "loc": "LEV.23.26+LEV.23.27+LEV.23.28+LEV.23.29+LEV.23.30+LEV.23.31+LEV.23.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lewi 23.26-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.29.7+NUM.29.8+NUM.29.9+NUM.29.10+NUM.29.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 29.7-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ibi bibabere itegeko ridakuka: mu kwezi kwa karindwi, ku munsi wako wa cumi, mujye mwibabaza imitima, ntimukagire umurimo muwukoraho, naho yaba kavukire cyangwa umunyamahanga usuhukiye muri mwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko uwo munsi ari ho muzajya muhongerererwa kugira ngo muhumanurwe, nuko imbere y'Uwiteka muzaba muhumanutse ibyaha byanyu byose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo munsi ujye ubabera isabato yo kuruhuka, mujye muwibabarizaho imitima, iryo ni itegeko ridakuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi umutambyi uzasīgwa akerezwa kuba umutambyi ngo azungure se, ajye abahongerera, yambare iyo myambaro y'ibitare, imyambaro yejejwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahongerere ubuturo bwera n'ihema ry'ibonaniro n'igicaniro, kandi ahongerere n'abatambyi n'abantu b'iteraniro bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iryo ribabere itegeko ridakuka, ko ajya ahongerera Abisirayeli impongano y'ibyaha byabo byose, rimwe uko umwaka utashye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
